  "description": "Pollard Rho (Brent) and deterministic Miller-Rabin for u64. factorize/factorize_cnt require n >= 1. Pass a seed to _pr(seed) for reproducible runs. Pass factorize_cnt(n) to phi/mobius/divisor_num/divisor_sum to reuse the factorization."
